------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Input transcriptomics are derived from the NASA Open Science Data Repository
(OSDR / GeneLab, https://osdr.nasa.gov, NASA Open Data policy) and NCBI GEO
(https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/). The single-cell foundation model uses the
Salk Arabidopsis Developmental Atlas (GEO GSE226097). Please cite the original
accessions when using this pipeline.
